## Scope
This article defines the content of the civil works to be executed for project **{{PROJECT_NAME}}** in the **{{COMMUNE}}** municipality.

## Content
- General and network earthworks (trench excavation);
- Separative foul (EU) and stormwater (EP) drainage networks;
- AEP network connected to the ONEE/utility network;
- Roadway: capping layer, base course, wearing course;
- Kerbs, gutters and footways.

## Reference documents
Works comply with **Fascicule 70** of the CCTG, standards **NM EN 1610** (installation and testing), **NM EN 805** (water networks), **Law 25-90** and **ONEE** specifications. In case of conflict, the priority order is: particular specification > stamped drawings > NM standards > CCTG.
